    <statement><p>Evaluate the triple integral
 <m>\displaystyle \iiint_E z \, dV,</m>
where <m>E</m> is bounded by the cylinder <m>y^2+z^2=36</m> and the planes <m>x=0,</m> <m>y=6 x,</m> and <m>z=0</m> in the first octant.</p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{6^{3}}{8}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
